    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Review uses the Wireframes and Use Cases exposed by Create Detailed Requirements and produces the decision for the exclusive choice. Rejection returns to Create Detailed Requirements for another pass. The diamond is the choice, not an extra work Step.</rdfs:comment>
